<title>USA: N-Vision Inc year loss widens.</title>
<headline>N-Vision Inc year loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenue				    $1,095,894	 $626,763</p>
<p> Net Loss				  (4,621,866)    (1,988,158)</p>
<p> Weighted Average Shares		 4,698,856	3,191,368</p>
<p> Loss per share				  (.98)	    (.62)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Net income for fiscal 1996 included a one-time non-cash interest and financing charge of $3,500,000 related to the compnay's initial public offering.</p>
<p>The weighted average shares did not include warrants convertible into common stock because they are anti-dilutive.</p>
